*** Keywords ***
General_SiSo_Auto_Cell_Block_Unblock
    [Documentation]
    ...             !!! IMPORTANT !! When executing test case with L3 call, if your testline is connected to programmable
    ...                              attenuator please ensure that all relevant ports are unattenuated as this test case
    ...                              will not handle attenuation.
    ...             ARGS:
    ...              - throughputs: dict with throughput and deviation values for each cell identified by
    ...                             it's nrCellIdentity for NR cells, eutranCellId for LTE cells, wnCelId for WCDMA cells;
    ...                             defaults to None (L3 call will not be executed).
    ...                             Example:
    ...                             {
    ...                                 '827736065':
    ...                                      {
    ...                                          'throughput':
    ...                                              {
    ...                                                  'downlink': '100 Mbits/sec',
    ...                                                  'uplink': '15 Mbits/sec'
    ...                                              },
    ...                                          'deviation': '90%'
    ...                                      },
    ...                             }
    ...              - protocol: data transfer protocol; defaults to UDP.
    ...              - udp_buffer: monitoring data buffer; defaults to 4M.
    ...              - tput_verification_via_btslog: True - throughput verification will be performed using btslog
    ...                                          False - throuput verification will be performed using iperf; defaults to False
    ...              - ue_network_modes: dict with UE serial numbers and desired network modes e.g. {"SN1234": "NR_only"}
    ...                                  possible UE network modes: NR_only, LTE_only, NR_LTE
    ...                                  when using more than one UE please make sure that the modes you choose are either all
    ...                                  with "_only" suffix or all "NR_LTE" as it is not yet possible to mix those.
    ...                                  mandatory for SA+NSA setups, defaults to None
    ...              - ues_and_cells: dict with UE serial numbers and lists of configuration distnames of cells to which they
    ...                               can be attached e.g. {"SN1234": ["MRBTS-50146/NRBTS-1/NRCELL-1", "MRBTS-50146/NRBTS-1/NRCELL-3"],
    ...                                                     "SN5678": ["MRBTS-50146/NRBTS-1/NRCELL-5"]}
    ...                               defaults to ${None} which means that all UEs will be attached to all cells.
    ...                               when given, listed cells will be called in pairs with specified UEs, if there are more
    ...                               cells on the setup that were not mentioned in the list, they will be called with all UEs
    ...              - cells_distnames: CONFIGURATION distnames of cells that will be called, if not given,
    ...                                 list of all cells on testline will be determined and called
    ...              - ignored_cells_on_preparation: SHOULD BE USED WITH `prepare_cells_to_call` set to True!
    ...                                              list of cells CONFIGURATION distnames that should be ignored during
    ...                                              L3 Call not called cells preparation procedure and not be blocked/barred

    [Arguments]                                 ${throughputs}=${None}
    ...                                         ${protocol}=udp
    ...                                         ${udp_buffer}=4M
    ...                                         ${tput_verification_via_btslog}=${False}
    ...                                         ${ue_network_modes}=${None}
    ...                                         ${ues_and_cells}=${None}
    ...                                         ${cells_distnames}=${None}
    ...                                         ${ignored_cells_on_preparation}=${None}

    ${bts_setup}=                               hwpta_testline.get_bts_setup_mode
    ${bts_type}=                                hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection}=                              connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                         bts_type=${bts_type}

    Allow DSS Alarms If DSS On Any RMOD         bts_type=${bts_type}
    Block all cells and check statuses          connection=${connection}
    ...                                         bts_type=${bts_type}
    Check Expected Alarms For Each Blocked Cell
    ...                                         connection=${connection}
    ...                                         bts_type=${bts_type}

    run keyword if                              ${throughputs}
    ...                                         Execute L3 call
    ...                                         attach_should_be_possible=${False}
    ...                                         throughputs=${throughputs}
    ...                                         cells_distnames=${cells_distnames}
    ...                                         protocol=${protocol}
    ...                                         udp_buffer=${udp_buffer}
    ...                                         ue_network_modes=${ue_network_modes}
    ...                                         ues_and_cells=${ues_and_cells}
    ...                                         should_fid49_be_disallowed=${False}
    ...                                         prepare_cells_to_call=${False}
    ...                                         ignored_cells_on_preparation=${ignored_cells_on_preparation}

    Check all RATs states when all cells are blocked
    ...                                         bts_type=${bts_type}
    Unblock all cells and check statuses        connection=${connection}
    ...                                         bts_type=${bts_type}
    Check if alarm is inactive                  fault_name=Cell blocked
    ...                                         fault_id=49

    @{bts_statuses_to_check}                    Create List
    ...                                         blockingState
    Check selected BTS state and all RATs states
    ...                                         bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                         bts_statuses_to_check=${bts_statuses_to_check}

    Disallow DSS Alarms If DSS On Any RMOD      bts_type=${bts_type}

    run keyword if                              ${throughputs}
    ...                                         Execute L3 call
    ...                                         throughputs=${throughputs}
    ...                                         cells_distnames=${cells_distnames}
    ...                                         protocol=${protocol}
    ...                                         udp_buffer=${udp_buffer}
    ...                                         tput_verification_via_btslog=${tput_verification_via_btslog}
    ...                                         ue_network_modes=${ue_network_modes}
    ...                                         ues_and_cells=${ues_and_cells}
    ...                                         ignored_cells_on_preparation=${ignored_cells_on_preparation}

    [Teardown]  run keyword and ignore error    Unblock all cells and check statuses
    ...                                         connection=${connection}
    ...                                         bts_type=${bts_type}


Check Expected Alarms For Each Blocked Cell
    [Arguments]                                 ${connection}
    ...                                         ${bts_type}
    ${expected_active_alarms_count}=            admin_info_model.get_number_of_blocked_cells
    ...                                         connection=${connection}

    Wait until keyword succeeds  60s  5s        Check number of active alarms
    ...                                         expected_number_of_alarms=${expected_active_alarms_count}
    ...                                         fault_name=Cell blocked
    ...                                         fault_id=49
    ...                                         bts_type=${bts_type}
